  11: `Encourage their participation in sports, dance, or physical activities to channel their energy positively. Teach them meditation or breathing techniques. Support their leadership potential and include them in decision-making processes. Avoid being overly controlling. Be careful about their physical safety and protect them from accidents. Build a safe social circle. Guide them in developing empathy and emotional awareness. Don't suppress their natural strength, but give them the chance to develop it.`,
