  17: `Guide them toward art, dance, or theater to discover their creative talents. Motivate them in their performances and increase their self-confidence by celebrating their successes. Deliver criticism constructively; teach them that failure is part of learning. Understand and listen to their emotional fragility. To reduce material dependency, teach the importance of spiritual values. Prevent a dependency on being praised.`,
