  20: `Create a supportive family environment and minimize negativity. Encourage them to make their own decisions, and avoid being overly protective. Channel their interest in technology into coding and educational games. Support creative thinking. Help them take on responsibility and teach them to express their ideas constructively. Help them find their own identity when they show imitative behavior. Understand the reason behind lies and address them constructively.`,
